POCRTL_BUILD: %X10000001
VMSDEF_BUILD: %X10000001
VMSLIB_BUILD: %X10000001
SPAWNUSE built: %X10000001
CHAINEDUSE built: %X10000001
Run
WRITE, to SPAWN1.OUT: SS$_NORMAL
  completion %X00010001
  | from a subprocess
%SYSTEM-F-ABORT, abort
EXIT 44: SS$_NORMAL
  completion %X0000002C
to the output of the caller
WRITE, to the caller's output: SS$_NORMAL
  completion %X00010001
inherited: SS$_NORMAL
  | STRING/a logical name
not inherited: SS$_NORMAL
  | /
input SPAWN3.COM: SS$_NORMAL
  completion %X00000003
  | from the input file
Start and Wait
Start first: SS$_NORMAL
Start second: SS$_NORMAL
  completion %X00010001
  second done: yes
  | second
Start WAIT 00:01:00: SS$_NORMAL
Stop: SS$_NORMAL
  completion %X00000001
  | first
LIB$SPAWN with a completion AST
LIB$SPAWN: SS$_NORMAL
  AST called: yes, parameter 7
  completion %X00010001
  | for the AST
LIB$SPAWN with a process name, twice, and one too long
first: SS$_NORMAL
second: SS$_DUPLNAM
too long: SS$_IVLOGNAM
  the first ended: yes
  completion %X00000001
the chain
LIB$PUT_COMMON: SS$_NORMAL
  length 30
a line with no Ln, before LIB$RUN_PROGRAM
ChainedUse: LIB$GET_COMMON status %X00000001, |a line through the common area|
ChainedUse ends by LIB$DO_COMMAND
from LIB$DO_COMMAND
run: %X00010001
after the run
